{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/11/20/4350069/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/11/20/4350069/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服、地味に好きです\n「地味に好き＝じみすき」流行らせましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(何言ってるんだみり愛)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、渡辺家に絢音がお泊りに来ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日もお仕事が一緒だったので\n2人でお家で渡辺家特製朝ごはんを食べ、\n電車に揺られながら仕事場へ行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂ではひめちゃんから貰った\nアロマキャンドルを楽しみながら\n2人でアメトーークを見つつ\n笑ってました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/11/20/4350069/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは結構前の写真ですが。\nいつもこんな感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当、ほぼ毎日一緒にいる気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/11/20/4350069/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈さんとマネージャーさんが\n分かるポーズ、らしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさんにそれを言われて\n花奈さんにお披露目しに行ったら\nこの顔o(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日一昨日と変な夢を見たんです。\nでも登場人物とかがリアルだし、\n内容とかもびっくりで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は見るかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様も、こんな変な夢見たな〜\nとかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まーぼおさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近時間が24時間じゃ足りないよ\nみりあは１日の時間を\n決められるならどのくらいほしい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私は24時間っていう\n今の時間が1番いいかなって\n思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時とかは足りないって\n思うけど、\nそうでないときは早く終われ〜なんて\n思っちゃうし(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめだるま＠千葉さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・喉の調子はどうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→心配してくださりありがとうございます！\n調子いいですよ〜o(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょっぺーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・生誕祭の写真、もっと引きのやつあげて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→全体のはあれだけなんです、、\nごめんなさい〜(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りょーへーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お誕生日ケーキ、いくつ食べた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→日にち分けたら6〜8個くらいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"種類がぜーんぶ違って。\n中でもまなったんのが1番美味しいし\nみり愛の好きなものが詰まったケーキ\nでした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっちゃんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・握手会でも言ったけど来年は\n生誕委員やってみようかな〜\nデザイナーなので何かお役に\n立てることもありそうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→生誕委員に入ろうと\n思ってくれた事に感謝です(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザイナーさんなんですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(私にぜひ絵心というものを教えてください)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様、ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のみりあんさーの答えは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごさん でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/11/20/4350069/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23日、楽しみです〜o(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}